# utility
evolutionmenu-utility-cybernetic-camouflage-name = Cybernetic Camouflage
evolutionmenu-utility-cybernetic-camouflage-desc =
    Turn your skin reflective to infrared light, making you undetectable by Silicon based beings.
    Costs 15 chemicals.

evolutionmenu-utility-contort-body-name = Contort Body
evolutionmenu-utility-contort-body-desc =
    Shifts your body into an unnatural state, allowing you to crawl into vents. You become visibly contorted doing this.
    Costs 15 chemicals.

evolutionmenu-combat-tentacle-name = Tentacle
evolutionmenu-combat-tentacle-desc =
    Reform one of your arms into a grotesque tentacle composed of muscle, able to latch onto and drag prey with ease.
    WARNING: Requires you to absorb at least 1 organic to use the ability.
    Costs 20 chemicals each time you summon it, and each time you retract it.
